To run the program, save the code to a file (e.g., `game_of_life.py`) and run it using Python (e.g., `python game_of_life.py`). The program will create a window with the menu, and you can navigate through the menu using the up and down arrow keys and select an option with the enter key. Once the game starts, the grid will update at a consistent rate, and you can close the window to exit the program.

